Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: add GPT-6.1 Sol to the OpenAI fallback model list

OpenAI released gpt-6.1-sol on 29 Sep 2026, and the list this branch gave
GPT-6 Sol and GPT-6 Luna on 22 Sep didn't have it yet. The temperature rule
from that commit already covers it, since it matches on the gpt-6 prefix.

Replay date: 29 Sep 2026
Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/changelog (29 Sep entry)
